      "text": "#PBBMGoodNews: METRO MANILA SUBWAY, FULL STEAM AHEAD! 🚄🇵🇭\n\nContinuous work to ensure comfortable travel for every Filipino family! 🚧\n\n#PBBMGoodNews from the DOTr: Right-of-Way (ROW) acquisition for the country’s very first subway is nearly complete!\n\n📈 THE PROGRESS REPORT:\n\n✅ Metro Manila Subway Project (MMSP): From just 51% in Feb 2025, the government has now secured a massive 90.76%!\n\n✅ NSCR North Segment: Progress for the North-South Commuter Railway is also now at 56%.\n\nBye-bye Traffic, Hello World-Class Transport! 👋🚄\n\nSince previous land issues (such as those in White Plains and Corinthian Gardens) have been resolved, actual construction will now accelerate! This follows the direct order of President @bongbongmarcos to fast-track the process so the public can benefit immediately.\n\nWe are getting closer to experiencing a world-class railway system. Just a little more patience, and traffic relief is on the way! 🙌\n\nPBBM | #SalamatPBBM | #BuildBetterMore | #MarcosPaRin | #BagongPilipinas | #PBBMgoodnews | #1stFive\n\nREAD MORE: https://t.co/r5humg2G4u",
