        "text": "♰ 🇵🇭 216 Thousand at Penitential Walk with Mary 🇵🇭 ♰\n\n🎥 The Penitential Walk with Mary is a major religious event in Cebu City, Philippines 🇵🇭, marking the culmination of the Novena Masses leading up to the Feast of the Santo Niño (Infant Jesus of Prague).  On January 15, 2026, approximately 216,000 devotees participated (according to Cebu Police) in the dawn procession, beginning at Fuente Osmeña and proceeding to the Basilica Minore del Santo Niño de Cebu.  The event, traditionally held on the ninth day of the novena, features thousands of faithful walking in prayer, carrying images of the Santo Niño and the Blessed Virgin Mary, often illuminated by candles. \n\nThe procession was peaceful and orderly, with 1,200 police personnel and force multipliers deployed by the Cebu City Police Office to ensure safety. Following the Mass at the Basilica, the images were transferred in the Traslacion to the National Shrine of St.  Joseph in Mandaue City for the fluvial procession on January 18.",
